  message: "Found via ci-debug pr-body (WI-filon), shipped one commit earlier — the owner asked to see PR #922's body, and the first body ever read through an approved script carried an unscrubbed vendor session URL on its last line. Not a duplicate of WI-filon: that item made PR bodies READABLE, this one makes them SCRUBBED."  # 0f7f
