- op: discuss  # 7f44
  at: '2026-09-16T02:02:56Z'  # 7f44
  by: agent  # 7f44
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 7f44
  clock: 7  # 7f44
  nonce: 7f44  # 7f44
  message: "Implemented. Scrub extracted to .githooks/brand-scrub.sh and sourced by lib/forgejo-api.sh, so one pattern list now governs all six egress points; commit-msg refactored onto the same library rather than keeping a second copy. Policy is commit-msg's (delete body lines, substitute titles) and the first/last-10-line window is kept, both per human decision. scripts/check-forge-text-egress enforces a declaration at every site and is proven non-vacuous by a planted unrouted site. Behavioural evidence: a real auto-pr run whose description ended in a vendor URL queued desc='Real prose that survives.' with the URL gone, title intact, exit 0, and 'removed 1 line(s)' on stderr. 1795 python tests + 59 hook tests green, mypy ratchet clean. Two defects found and fixed en route: the reporter read a variable set inside a command substitution (subshell) and the library read $HOME eagerly under set -u, both of which aborted callers silently; each is pinned by a regression test using the caller's real shape. WI-honat filed separately for the stderr suppression that hid them."  # 7f44
