  message: "Landed as PR #981 (merged via rebase, commit 8b166291a7). Production verification, not a proxy: 'ci-debug pr-body 981' — the same command that exposed the original leak — returns a body with 0 matches for claude.ai or /code/session_, ending at the DCO sign-off. The fix scrubbed its own PR."  # f802
